    <string name="guide_title">Connection guide</string>
    <string name="guide_steps">1. Join your NAS to the same ZeroTier network and enable its mihomo gateway.\n2. Scan a QR code or enter the network ID, NAS virtual IPv4 and check port.\n3. Allow the system VPN configuration and authorize this device in your ZeroTier controller.</string>
    <string name="guide_configure">Configure network</string>
    <string name="guide_authorization">Open this network in your ZeroTier controller. Find the device ID shown above in Members, authorize it and confirm an IPv4 address is assigned. Do not enter your controller password in this app.</string>
